---
// Step-by-step showdown: strings.TrimRight("todo.json", ".json") -> "tod" (cutset walk)
// vs strings.TrimSuffix("todo.json", ".json") -> "todo" (exact suffix check).
// Verified on Go 1.27.1 in prog_trim.
const W = 900;
const H = 310;

const chars = [
  { ch: 't', drop: false, stop: false },
  { ch: 'o', drop: false, stop: false },
  { ch: 'd', drop: false, stop: true },
  { ch: 'o', drop: true, stop: false },
  { ch: '.', drop: true, stop: false },
  { ch: 'j', drop: true, stop: false },
  { ch: 's', drop: true, stop: false },
  { ch: 'o', drop: true, stop: false },
  { ch: 'n', drop: true, stop: false },
];

const cellW = 54;
const startX = 24;
---
<figure class="gp11tc">
  <div class="gp11tc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: strings.TrimRight walks backward over todo.json checking each rune against the set dot, j, s, o, n; it strips .json and the o from todo, stopping at d and returning tod. Bottom: strings.TrimSuffix checks the trailing string .json once and returns todo.">
      {/* Panel 1: TrimRight */}
      <text x="24" y="26" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. strings.TrimRight("todo.json", ".json") strips any trailing rune in the set</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. strings.TrimRight("todo.json", ".json") cắt mọi rune ở đuôi thuộc tập ký tự</tspan>
      </text>

      {chars.map((c, i) => {
        const x = startX + i * (cellW + 4);
        const cls = c.drop ? 'cell bad' : c.stop ? 'cell gold' : 'cell';
        return (
          <g>
            <rect x={x} y="48" width={cellW} height="48" rx="5" class={cls} />
            <text x={x + cellW / 2} y="78" text-anchor="middle" class={c.drop ? 'r' : 'b'}>{c.ch}</text>
            {c.drop && (
              <text x={x + cellW / 2} y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="r">
                <tspan data-lang-en>cut</tspan>
                <tspan data-lang-vi>bỏ</tspan>
              </text>
            )}
            {c.stop && (
              <text x={x + cellW / 2} y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="g">
                <tspan data-lang-en>stop</tspan>
                <tspan data-lang-vi>dừng</tspan>
              </text>
            )}
          </g>
        );
      })}

      <rect x="574" y="48" width="302" height="66" rx="8" class="box bad" />
      <text x="590" y="74" class="r">
        <tspan data-lang-en>returns "tod"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trả về "tod"</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="590" y="96" class="m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>'o' in "todo" is also in cutset ".json"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>'o' trong "todo" cũng nằm trong ".json"</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="24" x2={W - 24} y1="146" y2="146" class="rule" />

      {/* Panel 2: TrimSuffix */}
      <text x="24" y="178" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. strings.TrimSuffix("todo.json", ".json") matches the whole suffix once</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. strings.TrimSuffix("todo.json", ".json") chỉ so đúng cả cụm đuôi một lần</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="24" y="200" width="228" height="48" rx="6" class="box gold" />
      <text x="138" y="230" text-anchor="middle" class="b">"todo"</text>

      <rect x="258" y="200" width="286" height="48" rx="6" class="free" />
      <text x="401" y="230" text-anchor="middle" class="m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>".json" matched and stripped once</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>khớp đúng ".json" và cắt một lần</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="574" y="200" width="302" height="66" rx="8" class="box gold" />
      <text x="590" y="226" class="g">
        <tspan data-lang-en>returns "todo"</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>trả về "todo"</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="590" y="248" class="m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>TrimPrefix works the same on the left</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>TrimPrefix cắt tương tự ở đầu chuỗi</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en><code>TrimRight</code>, <code>TrimLeft</code>, and <code>Trim</code> treat their second argument as a bag of individual runes, walking inward until a rune is absent from the set. When removing a file extension or URL suffix, use <code>TrimSuffix</code> (or <code>TrimPrefix</code>).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi><code>TrimRight</code>, <code>TrimLeft</code> và <code>Trim</code> xem tham số thứ hai là một tập hợp các rune rời nhau, cắt dần vào trong cho tới khi gặp ký tự không thuộc tập. Khi cần bỏ đuôi file hay hậu tố URL, hãy dùng <code>TrimSuffix</code> (hoặc <code>TrimPrefix</code>).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp11tc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp11tc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp11tc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp11tc text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp11tc .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp11tc .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp11tc .m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp11tc .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp11tc .g { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp11tc .cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp11tc .cell.bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp11tc .cell.gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gp11tc .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp11tc .box.bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp11tc .box.gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .gp11tc .free { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp11tc .rule { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp11tc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
